   The active-classical model separately checks the strictly stronger agreement and authenticity properties. *)
query attacker(INITIAL_SECRET).
query attacker(CACHED_SECRET).
query attacker(ADVANCE_SECRET).
query attacker(FUTURE_SECRET).
query attacker(BEACON_RECORD_SECRET).
